Track 3: Umbra Weaver's Pact
- Story & Context: They say the anonymous Umbra Weaver, an ancient entity of cosmic threads who orchestrates all eclipses from the grand loom where time itself unwinds, accepts only this music as tribute, granting brief, furious clarity before demanding years of silence; the carnival musicians believe their sacred solar eclipse performances, vibrating with the deep hum of a thousand plucked strings across dimensions, are a binding ritual to the Weaver, delaying the inevitable end of days. "One breath of totality, then the debt is due, till the next sun bleeds."
